class:: GeometryReverbScene
summary:: Prepared shoebox direct, first-order, and shared late-field model
categories:: UGens>Reverbs, Libraries>CamaraObscura
related:: Guides/CamaraObscura, Classes/GeometryReverb

description::

GeometryReverbScene prepares a fixed source/listener interpolation grid. Each
grid pair contains a direct path and six first-order image-source reflections
with delay, inverse-distance gain, horizontal direction, low-pass cutoff,
path type, and reflection generation. A shared eight-line FDN supplies the
late field after its shortest delay.

code::fromMesh:: intentionally throws: arbitrary mesh visibility, material
validation, and perceptual path pruning are not implemented. This first scene
does not claim diffraction, occlusion, elevation encoding, HRTF rendering, or
higher-order reflections. The closest vanilla facility is a bank of
link::Classes/DelayC:: UGens plus a reverb; GeometryReverbScene precomputes
motion-safe geometric paths and keeps all geometry work outside the callback.

classmethods::

method:: shoebox
Prepare a rectangular room.

argument:: size
Three positive dimensions in metres.

argument:: absorption
One wall absorption value or six values from 0 through 1.

argument:: sampleRate
Exact renderer sample rate.

argument:: seed
Late-field topology seed.

argument:: grid
Axis grid size from 2 through 4. Model storage grows with the sixth power of
this value.

argument:: lateT60
Late FDN low-band T60 in seconds.

method:: fromMesh
Unavailable legal API placeholder that always reports the unimplemented
validation/pruning requirement.

method:: read
Read a version-1 scene.

instancemethods::

method:: prepare
Return this already prepared scene.

method:: validate
Validate metadata, every path entry, timing/direction limits, and the shared
late-field topology.

method:: summary
Return concise diagnostics.

method:: load
Upload to a mono Buffer.

method:: write
Serialize the scene.

method:: free
Free the last uploaded Buffer.

method:: plot
Plot the three room dimensions.

examples::

code::
(
var scene = GeometryReverbScene.shoebox(
    [8, 6, 3], 0.25,
    sampleRate: 48000, seed: 4,
    grid: 3, lateT60: 2.8
);
scene.summary.postln;
scene.plot;
)
::

code::
(
var scene = GeometryReverbScene.shoebox(
    [5, 4, 2.8],
    [0.1, 0.5, 0.2, 0.6, 0.3, 0.4],
    sampleRate: 48000,
    grid: 2,
    lateT60: 1.4
);
scene.validate;
scene.summary.postln;
)
::

